<Project>

  <!--
    The build-time gates moved to the commit hook (`.git/hooks/pre-commit` runs
    tools/check-step-read.ps1, tools/check-reading-evidence.ps1 and
    tools/check-src-guard.ps1 -Commit): MSBuild runs every <Exec> through a temporary
    `.exec.cmd` file, and this machine's antivirus flags that file on every build.
    The guarantees are unchanged — nothing enters a commit without the three checks, a
    dirty `src/` with the game running is still refused, and `deploy.ps1` still refuses a
    dirty tree; only the early refusal at compile time is gone.
  -->

</Project>
